        {"2628997c9ec9f5cb5502298d06576336c85b9de08d9ed4ccd068ec2cb5ee3bf3":"ＴＰ消費軽減＋5","5b5e79a84743e7bd82981705a49b0786f46624171354c91c89f717616e27be12":31004,"c807aef88c2571044d5a76ea9639bed74b6f8220ab0ad862fd2203729ecee83a":31004,"5515f4ace45482af8748cdfead5c1a370ee8b51615adf98656853b5ab631b5e7":3,"cfb3396407224e55f8d9dae6ceaa9ceb4fe021ee51aed3c7130badb0631414e5":3,"5c529b8f21ee197d700601b7534a66c33e329f373ff5c4f03d6a538e412d0e02":"永天鏡の王笏","dcd1468f0731046612a8421f55aaec5e4bb664f5c2cc9f1f7c02afdbc1f181a2":1,"a6512821f224154e01cbbd3bdf845777d6e914cdce3c266d1198b38a03fefe6d":"不思議な効果を持つ、かつて天界\\nに伝えられし杖。天にかざすと鏡\\n⽟に篭められた祈りが溢れ出して\\n尽きることなき力を授ける。"},
        {"2628997c9ec9f5cb5502298d06576336c85b9de08d9ed4ccd068ec2cb5ee3bf3":"重複可能の行動速度＋30％","5b5e79a84743e7bd82981705a49b0786f46624171354c91c89f717616e27be12":31005,"c807aef88c2571044d5a76ea9639bed74b6f8220ab0ad862fd2203729ecee83a":31005,"5515f4ace45482af8748cdfead5c1a370ee8b51615adf98656853b5ab631b5e7":3,"cfb3396407224e55f8d9dae6ceaa9ceb4fe021ee51aed3c7130badb0631414e5":3,"5c529b8f21ee197d700601b7534a66c33e329f373ff5c4f03d6a538e412d0e02":"熾天使の翔靴","dcd1468f0731046612a8421f55aaec5e4bb664f5c2cc9f1f7c02afdbc1f181a2":1,"a6512821f224154e01cbbd3bdf845777d6e914cdce3c266d1198b38a03fefe6d":"不思議な効果を持つ、天使の加護\\nを宿した戦靴。装備するだけで神\\n性を授かり、天使のような自在さ\\nで空を翔ることができる。"},
        {"2628997c9ec9f5cb5502298d06576336c85b9de08d9ed4ccd068ec2cb5ee3bf3":"デバフ強化＋30","5b5e79a84743e7bd82981705a49b0786f46624171354c91c89f717616e27be12":32001,"c807aef88c2571044d5a76ea9639bed74b6f8220ab0ad862fd2203729ecee83a":32001,"5515f4ace45482af8748cdfead5c1a370ee8b51615adf98656853b5ab631b5e7":3,"cfb3396407224e55f8d9dae6ceaa9ceb4fe021ee51aed3c7130badb0631414e5":3,"5c529b8f21ee197d700601b7534a66c33e329f373ff5c4f03d6a538e412d0e02":"幻獣飾テンタシオン","dcd1468f0731046612a8421f55aaec5e4bb664f5c2cc9f1f7c02afdbc1f181a2":2,"a6512821f224154e01cbbd3bdf845777d6e914cdce3c266d1198b38a03fefe6d":"不思議な効果を持つ、幻獣を象る\\n首飾り。この宝石の神秘に魅せら\\nれた者は、一切の異変や脅威に抗\\nうことができなくなってしまう。"},
