        {"2628997c9ec9f5cb5502298d06576336c85b9de08d9ed4ccd068ec2cb5ee3bf3":"ＨＰ吸収＋30","5b5e79a84743e7bd82981705a49b0786f46624171354c91c89f717616e27be12":33005,"c807aef88c2571044d5a76ea9639bed74b6f8220ab0ad862fd2203729ecee83a":33005,"5515f4ace45482af8748cdfead5c1a370ee8b51615adf98656853b5ab631b5e7":3,"cfb3396407224e55f8d9dae6ceaa9ceb4fe021ee51aed3c7130badb0631414e5":3,"5c529b8f21ee197d700601b7534a66c33e329f373ff5c4f03d6a538e412d0e02":"ザ・ハーヴェスト","dcd1468f0731046612a8421f55aaec5e4bb664f5c2cc9f1f7c02afdbc1f181a2":3,"a6512821f224154e01cbbd3bdf845777d6e914cdce3c266d1198b38a03fefe6d":"不思議な効果を持つ、金色の⼤戦\\n斧。刈り取った獲物の魂を糧に、\\nその絢爛なる刃は燦燦と輝きを増\\nしてゆく。"},
        {"2628997c9ec9f5cb5502298d06576336c85b9de08d9ed4ccd068ec2cb5ee3bf3":"バフ強化＋30","5b5e79a84743e7bd82981705a49b0786f46624171354c91c89f717616e27be12":34001,"c807aef88c2571044d5a76ea9639bed74b6f8220ab0ad862fd2203729ecee83a":34001,"5515f4ace45482af8748cdfead5c1a370ee8b51615adf98656853b5ab631b5e7":3,"cfb3396407224e55f8d9dae6ceaa9ceb4fe021ee51aed3c7130badb0631414e5":3,"5c529b8f21ee197d700601b7534a66c33e329f373ff5c4f03d6a538e412d0e02":"極醒のアミュレット","dcd1468f0731046612a8421f55aaec5e4bb664f5c2cc9f1f7c02afdbc1f181a2":4,"a6512821f224154e01cbbd3bdf845777d6e914cdce3c266d1198b38a03fefe6d":"不思議な効果を持つ、炎天の魔力\\nを封じた耳飾り。潜在能力を究極\\nまで呼び覚まし、強化の力を大幅\\nに上昇させる。"},
        {"2628997c9ec9f5cb5502298d06576336c85b9de08d9ed4ccd068ec2cb5ee3bf3":"物理/魔法攻撃力アップ\\n（先頭キャラの物理防御力×15）","5b5e79a84743e7bd82981705a49b0786f46624171354c91c89f717616e27be12":34002,"c807aef88c2571044d5a76ea9639bed74b6f8220ab0ad862fd2203729ecee83a":34002,"5515f4ace45482af8748cdfead5c1a370ee8b51615adf98656853b5ab631b5e7":3,"cfb3396407224e55f8d9dae6ceaa9ceb4fe021ee51aed3c7130badb0631414e5":3,"5c529b8f21ee197d700601b7534a66c33e329f373ff5c4f03d6a538e412d0e02":"断刃拒絶のアルギュロス","dcd1468f0731046612a8421f55aaec5e4bb664f5c2cc9f1f7c02afdbc1f181a2":4,"a6512821f224154e01cbbd3bdf845777d6e914cdce3c266d1198b38a03fefe6d":"不思議な効果を持つ、⽩⾦の鎧。\\n⽩⻯の鱗を繋ぎ合わせた外装が盟\\n友の力を集結させる効果を持ち強\\n力無比な一撃を可能にする。"},
        {"2628997c9ec9f5cb5502298d06576336c85b9de08d9ed4ccd068ec2cb5ee3bf3":"物理/魔法攻撃力アップ\\n（先頭キャラの魔法防御力×15）","5b5e79a84743e7bd82981705a49b0786f46624171354c91c89f717616e27be12":34003,"c807aef88c2571044d5a76ea9639bed74b6f8220ab0ad862fd2203729ecee83a":34003,"5515f4ace45482af8748cdfead5c1a370ee8b51615adf98656853b5ab631b5e7":3,"cfb3396407224e55f8d9dae6ceaa9ceb4fe021ee51aed3c7130badb0631414e5":3,"5c529b8f21ee197d700601b7534a66c33e329f373ff5c4f03d6a538e412d0e02":"緋華栄華のグラナート","dcd1468f0731046612a8421f55aaec5e4bb664f5c2cc9f1f7c02afdbc1f181a2":4,"a6512821f224154e01cbbd3bdf845777d6e914cdce3c266d1198b38a03fefe6d":"不思議な効果を持つ、栄華の象徴\\nとして仕立てられたドレス。深紅\\nに咲き乱れる花の加護は、装備者\\nの絶魔の⼒を攻撃⼒へ変換する。"},
