        {"2628997c9ec9f5cb5502298d06576336c85b9de08d9ed4ccd068ec2cb5ee3bf3":"継続ＨＰ回復（毎秒【守備】数×1500回復）","5b5e79a84743e7bd82981705a49b0786f46624171354c91c89f717616e27be12":35005,"c807aef88c2571044d5a76ea9639bed74b6f8220ab0ad862fd2203729ecee83a":35005,"5515f4ace45482af8748cdfead5c1a370ee8b51615adf98656853b5ab631b5e7":3,"cfb3396407224e55f8d9dae6ceaa9ceb4fe021ee51aed3c7130badb0631414e5":3,"5c529b8f21ee197d700601b7534a66c33e329f373ff5c4f03d6a538e412d0e02":"輪廻ノ翡翠珠輪","dcd1468f0731046612a8421f55aaec5e4bb664f5c2cc9f1f7c02afdbc1f181a2":5,"a6512821f224154e01cbbd3bdf845777d6e914cdce3c266d1198b38a03fefe6d":"不思議な効果を持つ、翠宝玉をあ\\nしらった腕輪。常に滾々とマナが\\n湧き出し、生命力を湛え続ける。"}
